{"id":"f4217d0f3a289dfe","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-tree8-special-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Special Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-special-tree — ZFC Tree8 Special Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-special-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-special-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-special-tree — ZFC Tree8 Special Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-special-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-special-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-special-tree — ZFC Tree8 Special Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c761b83cda5ce36\" href=\"?note=6c761b83cda5ce36\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree8-specializing-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\leq_T,f\\in V\">\\(T,\\leq_T,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecialTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecialTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}special\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecialTree}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\n\\exists f\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,\\omega)\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\ns\\ne t\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\n\\to f(s)\\ne f(t)\n\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}special\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SpecialTree}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\n\\exists f\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,\\omega)\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\ns\\ne t\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\n\\to f(s)\\ne f(t)\n\\right)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, the fibers of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> form countably many antichains covering the\ntyped tree.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":